[I] Intel graphics memory management library

[T] The Intel Graphics Memory Management Library provides device specific
[T] and buffer management for the Intel Graphics Compute Runtime for
[T] OpenCL and the Intel Media Driver for VAAPI.

[U] https://github.com/intel/gmmlib/

[A] Intel
[M] NoTag <notag@t2sde.org>

[C] base/x11
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[R] + arm64 x86-64 

[L] OpenSource
[V] 22.10.1
[P] X -----5---9 127.600

[D] b4daf00da3f94747980c53b35b7aa2ea473d0e559ed76486d10b3dc6 intel-gmmlib-22.10.1.tar.gz https://github.com/intel/gmmlib/archive/

var_append cmakeopt ' ' -DRUN_TEST_SUITE=OFF
[[ $arch = x86* ]] && var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -msse4.1
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_REMOVE ' ' -Werror=format-security
